{"parse": {"title": "1ST-10", "pageid": 6026, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/1ST-09\" title=\"1ST-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">1ST-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/1ST-11\" title=\"1ST-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">1ST</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B7.B7.E6.B2.8C.E8.9D.B4.E8.9D.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"混沌蝴蝶\">混沌蝴蝶</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 混沌蝴蝶</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Origin Butterfly</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>科<span class=\"color-value\"></span>学<span class=\"color-value\"></span>家<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>首<span class=\"color-value\"></span>次<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>握<span class=\"color-value\"></span>手<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>敬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>礼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>亲<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>朋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>友<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>知<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>真<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>吗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_dianhuatexie\"><img alt=\"at_dianhuatexie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/600px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/900px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/1200px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您好。请帮我联系圣洛夫基金委的Z女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>嗯，是你。怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想申请查阅1929年美国金融市场的历史情报，具体为华尔街股灾的史实日期，以及股票交易手段中神秘学的参与程度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>还有吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……还有，我请求新增兵力支援今晚的暴雨集会，必须身着常服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>1929年股灾的第一史实日期为10月24日星期四，并在28日、29日持续爆发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>部门情报显示，该事件无神秘学界势力参与。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>重塑在人为地改变历史，Z女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>我会给你一支特别行动队以及最高指挥权。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-501201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>在没有调查清楚他们改变历史的原因之前，不要轻举妄动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>收到。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>看来你的朋友遇上了一点小麻烦，星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……啧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我说，这些手续签完就没我什么事儿了吧？接下来是要去科算中心的办事处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>没错。我带你去办事处吧，星锑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>嗯，这是我们的机械科学家X。正好能让他给你介绍一下我们的科研设备……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>虽然你以摇滚出名，但我听说你对人类的科学技术也很感兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哦，原来如此。那我就不用自我介绍了，你叫我船长R就行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>呵呵……我们的名字不是这个意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>跟我来吧，远方的朋友。我有很多有意思的新鲜玩意儿想和你聊聊呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>办事处是仅隶属于基金会的科算中心唯一分部，因此，能共享的也只有这些纸面研发资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿！怎么突然停下来了？搞得我差点撞你身上了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>科算中心相关的史料分享结束了，观光之旅就到这里为止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你想了解一些更有意思的东西吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>比如……“暴雨”的真相？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……你知道些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不是我，是我们。一个在科算中心的内部机构……洛伦兹研究所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这次邀请你来参观科算中心的，就是我们。尽管你没有带着“小东西”在身上，但我相信，我们仍有相互了解的必要～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>哼，怎么，看来你们基金会每一个人都是情报专家？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们不属于基金会……甚至不属于科算中心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>与那些冲着“小东西”来袭击你的重塑暴徒不同……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们只对有着求索精神的神秘学家感兴趣，其他的一切，与我们无关。<br />为了更好的认识“暴雨”，洛伦兹需要更多有才能的合作者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-302401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_xingtidaoying\"><img alt=\"at_xingtidaoying\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png/600px-Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png/900px-Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png/1200px-Cg-at_xingtidaoying.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这么说来，前面的这个门，通往的就是你们的秘密基地？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>目前是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>里面什么东西都看不到啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>不知道维尔汀和十四行诗现在在做些什么呢……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "1ST-10"}}